add('structure','11a16–12a5 completes chronology/flood proofs from the prior baraita.12a6 resumes vegetables/tithes/vows headings.12a10 begins a harvest case unfinished until12b1; its derivations continue through12b5.12b6 shifts to vows.','11a:16','12a:5','12a:6','12a:10','12b:1','12b:5','12b:6')
